---

---

<section
  class="relative mx-auto my-8 max-w-5xl rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white/90 p-8 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-10"
>
  <div
    class="mb-6 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 px-6 py-5 text-white shadow-inner sm:px-8 sm:py-6"
  >
    <p class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-sm text-blue-100">
      Take Action
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">
      Boston City Council is considering a zoning amendment to remove outdated
      parking mandates.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-blue-100 sm:text-lg">
      Here are three actions you can take to show the City Council and Planning
      Department that Boston says YES to parking flexibility!
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <article
      class="rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md"
    >
      <p class="text-2xl">📚</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Read the Explainer</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-6">
        Arm yourself with knowledge on the proposed amendment.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BiGuGKiloqosrUf2SYQjc1iiU8Wp7I7U/view"
        class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700"
        target="_blank"
      >
        PDF link
      </a>
    </article>

    <article
      class="rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md"
    >
      <p class="text-2xl">✍️</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Submit a Written Letter</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-6">
        Use this tool to write and send a public comment in under 2 minutes.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://action.betterparkingforboston.org"
        class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Submit comment
      </a>
    </article>

    <article
      class="rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md"
    >
      <p class="text-2xl">📋</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Add Your Name</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-6">
        Show that Bostonians support parking flexibility for more homes.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://petition.betterparkingforboston.org"
        class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Sign the petition
      </a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
